  "description": "DINTIG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C38 H84 Co5 Eu4 N2 O44,3.75(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Co1 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co2 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co3 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co4 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Co5 (Co) has 6 O neighbors; Eu1 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.107-3.938 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.88-111.52°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C42H100N2O48Co5Eu4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 12 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
